  "body": [
    "Careers How to Apply",
    "How to Apply",
    "Nearly 27,000 people are employed by UT MD Anderson, including more than 1,900 faculty members.",
    "With faculty and staff working in more than 25 buildings in Houston and Central Texas, UT MD Anderson is one of the largest cancer centers in the world.",
    "There's an opportunity for everyone on our dynamic team. Whether you're in the clinic or the laboratory, the office or out in the community, there's a place for you as we work to eliminate cancer around the globe.",
    "Where will you be when a cure is found?",
    "Become part of UT MD Anderson's steadfast mission to eliminate cancer.",
    "Volunteer Opportunities Cover the spectrum from direct patient contact through traditional services and work requiring other special skills.",
    "Cover the spectrum from direct patient contact through traditional services and work requiring other special skills.",
    "Nursing at UT MD Anderson Our nurses have opportunities for professional growth, while still being able to balance work and personal lives.",
    "Our nurses have opportunities for professional growth, while still being able to balance work and personal lives.",
    "Residency and Fellowship Programs Specialists put their education into practice through participation in key research programs.",
    "Specialists put their education into practice through participation in key research programs.",
    "Hiring Red, White and You UT MD Anderson is committed to welcoming those who have faithfully served in the military.",
    "UT MD Anderson is committed to welcoming those who have faithfully served in the military.",
    "Faculty Opportunities Clinical, research and leadership positions are available in our world-renowned clinics and labs.",
    "Clinical, research and leadership positions are available in our world-renowned clinics and labs.",
    "Faculty Support Services All UT MD Anderson faculty have extra-curricular and development activities available.",
    "All UT MD Anderson faculty have extra-curricular and development activities available.",
    "Trainee Positions UT MD Anderson’s training opportunities provide access to world-renowned clinics and labs.",
    "UT MD Anderson’s training opportunities provide access to world-renowned clinics and labs.",
    "To apply for a position at UT MD Anderson, follow the steps below:",
    "View our career opportunities by searching by keyword, location or job category.",
    "Once you’ve found a position of interest, click on the title to review details and requirements.",
    "Select the “Apply for Job” button to start your application.",
    "View more information about how to apply for a job at UT MD Anderson.",
    "Check your email for status updates or by clicking on the “My Submissions” box when you are logged into the job application system.",
    "Please email recruitmentsr@MDAnderson.org with any questions you have about your account or the job applications system.",
    "UT MD Anderson is committed to encouraging good health and staying true to our mission to end cancer. We are a tobacco-free employer and if offered a position at UT MD Anderson, you are required to take a pre-employment drug screen for tobacco compounds.",
    "Ready to quit? We’re ready to help. If you are a current tobacco user and would like to quit, we encourage you to enroll in one of our Tobacco Treatment Program’s clinical trials that combine the use of medications and counseling to help you quit. To enroll, call 713-792-2265 or email QuitNow@MDAnderson.org.",
    "Our patients depend on blood and platelet donations.",
    "Show your support for our mission through branded merchandise.",
